eshwari Temple), summarised; location via OpenStreetMap","architecture_style":null,"construction_century":20},{"id":"299f8f24-2188-46a5-a67a-b867c180b575","name":"Maha Mrityunjay Temple","deity":"Shiva","sampradaya":"Shaiva","significance":[],"country":"India","state":"Assam","district":"Nagaon","town":"Puranigudam","latitude":26.343,"longitude":92.7761,"sandhya_friendly":"unknown","sandhya_notes":null,"samidhadhanam_friendly":"unknown","samidhadhanam_notes":null,"food_tier":"unknown","food_source_name":null,"food_source_contact":null,"food_distance_km":null,"nearest_river_name":"Kolong River","river_distance_km":1.9,"best_season_notes":null,"submitted_by":null,"status":"approved","verified_by":null,"moderator_note":null,"created_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:38.196668+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T02:38:03.965515+00:00","sthala_purana":"A Shiva temple at Nagaon, Assam, whose building is shaped like a Shivling. It is described as the largest Shivalinga in the world, 126 feet high, a feature that makes it distinctive and attractive to devotees.","etiquette_notes":null,"native_name":null,"morning_opens_at":null,"morning_closes_at":null,"evening_opens_at":null,"evening_closes_at":null,"timings_notes":null,"accessibility_notes":null,"nearest_airport_name":"Tezpur Air Force Station","nearest_airport_distance_km":41.2,"nearest_railway_station_name":"Nagaon railway station","nearest_railway_distance_km":7.8,"emergency_contact_notes":null,"sthala_purana_source":"Wikipedia (Maha Mrityunjay Temple), summarised; location via OpenStreetMap","architecture_style":"Built in the form of a Shivalinga","construction_century":null},{"id":"29c68790-0d4f-4886-82e6-9406f3cbfdbf","name":"Marundeeswarar Temple","deity":"Shiva as Marundeeswarar","sampradaya":"Shaiva","significance":[],"country":"India","state":"Tamil Nadu","district":"Chennai","town":"Chennai","latitude":12.98556,"longitude":80.26139,"sandhya_friendly":"unknown","sandhya_notes":null,"samidhadhanam_friendly":"unknown","samidhadhan